<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Norsk Hydro buy of fertiliser unit.</title>
<headline>EU clears Norsk Hydro buy of fertiliser unit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared plans by a Dutch unit of Norwegian oil and gas giant Norsk Hydro to buy Enichem SpA's fertiliser unit at Terni Industrie Chimiche SpA, a European Union source said on Monday.</p>
<p>Under the deal, announced on September 5, Hydro Agri Nederland BVA, a unit of Norsk Hydro, acquires control of Terni Industrie Chimiche, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Enichem.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
